# ==============================================================================
# 🇸🇴 Gelinta iyo Soo Saaridda ee Koor (Input / Output in Koor)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. SOO SAARIDDA (OUTPUT)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# A. Qoraal toos ah (Direct string):
waxaad soo saartaa "Ku soo dhawoow Koor!".

# B. Soo saarid leh doorsoomayaal gudaha ah (String Interpolation with {var}):
magac waa "Aamina".
da' waa 23.
waxaad soo saartaa "Magaca waa {magac}, da'duna waa {da'}.".

# C. Erayada kale ee soo saarista (daabac / qor / soo saar):
daabac "Tani waxay u dhigantaa 'print'.".
qor "Qoraal kooban.".
soo saar "Xisaab: 5 * 10 = " + qoraal(5 * 10).

# D. Soo saarista xogaha adag (Lists, Dicts, Booleans):
waxaad soo saartaa "Liis: ", [10, 20, 30].
waxaad soo saartaa "Qaamuus: ", {"magaalo": "Muqdisho", "sanad": 2026}.
waxaad soo saartaa "Run/Been: ", run, been, waxba.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. GELINTA (INPUT)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# A. Qaadashada qoraal (Text input):
# magac_qof waa waydiin("Fadlan geli magacaaga: ").
# waxaad soo saartaa "Salaan sare, {magac_qof}!".

# B. Qaadashada tiro iyo xisaabinta (Number input with type conversion):
# sanad_dhalasho waa tiro(waydiin("Geli sanadkii aad dhalatay: ")).
# da_hadda waa 2026 - sanad_dhalasho.
# waxaad soo saartaa "Da'daadu sanadkan waa: {da_hadda} sano.".
